"""The posix module's functions, gathered from its area modules for the
generated clinic glue (bindings/clinic/posix.jac).

Derived from CPython 3.14.6 Modules/posixmodule.c; see ../LICENSE.cpython.
The areas: posix_core (path_t, converters, errors, module state, the
exported C API), posix_stat (stat, statvfs, listdir, scandir, DirEntry),
posix_files (filesystem operations), posix_fileio (descriptor I/O,
terminals, eventfd and timerfd), posix_process (fork, exec, spawn, wait,
scheduling) and posix_ids (ids, groups, uname, sysconf, the environment).
